title: Silent Mode / Police Dark Car Mode
raw_community_title: ⚡ [Lightning] Silent Mode / Police Dark Car Mode
category: Lighting
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: All
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: '[Category: Lighting] [Years: 2022-2026] [Original Title: Enable Silent Mode
  (AKA campground / dark mode)]

  Creates a SYNC toggle to turn on/off Silent Mode. Enables silent mode. Silent Mode
  turns off cluster lighting, welcome lighting, courtesy lights, and SYNC screen when
  opening doors; also silences the horn when locking doors.'
steps:
- module: BCM
  address: 726-25-02
  targets:
  - mask: '*xxx xxxx xx--'
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
    - bit: 0
      action: 0
  - mask: x*xx xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '1'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature: Feat_Cfg [SILENTMODE] [PERS_1] (SILENTMODE_PERS_1)
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
    - bit: 0
      action: 0
  - mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
